WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:03.520
♪Shrugging off past burdens♪

00:03.520 --> 00:06.110
♪Beneath the mask, who am I?♪

00:06.780 --> 00:10.180
♪Release and find wider shores♪

00:11.880 --> 00:14.890
♪Love's a riddle, and rain pours heavy♪

00:15.260 --> 00:17.790
♪Crossed paths, now downward fall♪

00:18.130 --> 00:21.570
♪From dust arises starlight's spark♪

00:23.320 --> 00:28.540
♪Tearing through
the night's dense blockade♪

00:29.220 --> 00:34.300
♪Heart's flame illuminates all solitude♪

00:35.100 --> 00:37.590
♪Let time's sails drift endlessly♪

00:37.590 --> 00:40.200
♪Through wandering exile♪

00:40.720 --> 00:47.980
♪Breaking free from the cocoon,
I start anew♪

00:48.950 --> 00:51.710
♪Moon as song, life as flame♪

00:51.770 --> 00:54.610
♪Nameless heart clings fiercely♪

00:54.900 --> 00:55.930
♪Let me♪

00:56.120 --> 01:00.200
♪Charge toward the next raging river♪

01:00.650 --> 01:03.330
♪Moon darts, snow falls♪

01:03.620 --> 01:06.320
♪We tread rugged paths to reunite♪

01:06.490 --> 01:07.960
♪Hands held tight♪

01:07.960 --> 01:12.130
♪We forever live for love's sake♪

01:12.490 --> 01:22.740
♪Shadow's spear burns fiercely♪

01:24.170 --> 01:29.720
=Legend of The Female General=

01:29.950 --> 01:32.860
=Episode 12=

01:51.229 --> 01:51.910
You're awake.

01:54.430 --> 01:55.830
How do you feel? Feeling better?

01:57.270 --> 01:58.550
Thank you for your concern.

01:59.030 --> 02:00.160
I feel better now.

02:00.480 --> 02:01.030
By the way,

02:01.390 --> 02:02.390
what's your name?

02:03.270 --> 02:04.470
My name is Hu Yuanzhong.

02:04.870 --> 02:05.670
All these years,

02:06.070 --> 02:07.310
I've made my living by hunting.

02:07.630 --> 02:08.910
Thank you for saving me.

02:09.990 --> 02:11.070
Stay still.

02:11.310 --> 02:12.710
Your wound might reopen otherwise.

02:12.930 --> 02:13.510
Well,

02:13.990 --> 02:15.230
let me apply the medicine.

02:15.470 --> 02:17.070
The oral medication isn't ready yet.

02:17.630 --> 02:19.630
Cheng Lisu is always so slow.

02:20.750 --> 02:21.310
No need.

02:21.630 --> 02:23.030
I can do it myself.

02:24.270 --> 02:24.990
Miss Song.

02:25.630 --> 02:27.590
You're a lady. This isn't proper.

02:28.150 --> 02:29.510
I'm a man. Let me do this.

02:31.750 --> 02:32.310
Well,

02:32.420 --> 02:33.710
I'll go hurry Cheng Lisu.

02:33.710 --> 02:34.230
Okay.

02:46.550 --> 02:47.750
Thank you, sir.

02:47.829 --> 02:48.390
No problem.

02:56.430 --> 02:58.870
Judging by your attire,
you don't seem to be from Wei.

03:02.310 --> 03:03.350
I'm from Liehe.

03:04.270 --> 03:04.990
However,

03:05.110 --> 03:06.190
I left the Liehe tribe

03:06.270 --> 03:07.270
many years ago.

03:08.590 --> 03:09.910
You're an experienced hunter.

03:10.150 --> 03:10.750
Why did you

03:10.790 --> 03:12.070
go out in such harsh winds?

03:13.950 --> 03:14.950
My wife

03:15.670 --> 03:16.670
just passed away.

03:17.590 --> 03:18.990
I miss her terribly,

03:19.270 --> 03:20.710
so I visited her grave,

03:20.950 --> 03:21.750
braving the winds.

03:23.590 --> 03:24.750
I notice many red rashes

03:24.829 --> 03:26.070
on your hands.

03:26.630 --> 03:27.310
I'll ask Taotao

03:27.310 --> 03:28.150
to prepare medicine?

03:30.310 --> 03:31.190
No need.

03:31.590 --> 03:33.230
Poisonous weeds hurt my hands

03:33.550 --> 03:35.110
when I climbed up the hill.

03:35.230 --> 03:36.110
They'll heal soon.

03:36.480 --> 03:37.430
Alright then.

03:54.790 --> 03:55.550
Medicine's ready.

03:59.030 --> 03:59.670
Thank you.

04:01.830 --> 04:02.470
I'm sorry.

04:02.510 --> 04:03.150
Are you okay?

04:03.430 --> 04:03.990
Are you hurt?

04:04.550 --> 04:05.110
Give it to me.

04:14.150 --> 04:15.110
Liehe's characters.

04:15.310 --> 04:16.589
My late wife wrote it.

04:17.430 --> 04:18.950
It's a love poem in the Liehe tribe.

04:21.510 --> 04:22.590
My apologies.

04:22.870 --> 04:25.150
I don't know it's your wife's stuff.
I was just curious.

04:25.790 --> 04:26.750
You're not mad, are you?

04:34.550 --> 04:35.100
What's wrong?

04:36.390 --> 04:37.230
He.

04:37.630 --> 04:38.630
When his injuries heal,

04:38.670 --> 04:39.750
he'll leave naturally.

04:40.270 --> 04:41.510
Stop being jealous.

05:11.030 --> 05:12.070
He.

05:12.550 --> 05:13.270
Miss Song.

05:15.670 --> 05:16.790
My apologies.

05:16.960 --> 05:18.950
I was practicing archery
and accidentally missed.

05:18.950 --> 05:19.550
Are you okay?

05:20.150 --> 05:20.790
He.

05:21.150 --> 05:22.750
I know you dislike Hu Yuanzhong.

05:23.350 --> 05:24.830
But he's just a patient.

05:25.150 --> 05:26.750
Your repeated targeting of him

05:27.030 --> 05:28.510
has gone too far.

05:30.150 --> 05:30.750
It's fine.

05:30.990 --> 05:31.630
I guess

05:31.670 --> 05:33.070
he was joking with me.

05:34.070 --> 05:34.830
I'm fine

05:34.870 --> 05:35.670
and uninjured.

05:36.909 --> 05:38.030
If this happens again,

05:38.430 --> 05:39.790
I'll get angry with you.

05:40.290 --> 05:40.950
Got it.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.110
Excuse me,

05:42.510 --> 05:43.430
I'll take my leave now.

06:57.830 --> 06:58.390
Stop!

07:02.510 --> 07:03.110
Oh, no.

07:03.190 --> 07:03.870
It's a trap.

07:07.590 --> 07:08.510
I didn't kill him!

07:08.990 --> 07:09.990
A man in black

07:10.230 --> 07:11.030
acted strange.

07:11.350 --> 07:11.990
I wounded him,

07:12.230 --> 07:12.870
but I didn't

07:12.990 --> 07:13.910
kill Instructor Ma.

07:14.630 --> 07:16.350
Instructor Ma
must've been killed earlier.

07:16.750 --> 07:17.350
The killer

07:17.550 --> 07:18.590
intended to frame me.

07:19.150 --> 07:19.590
Fine.

07:20.350 --> 07:21.950
I'll give you a chance to explain.

07:22.710 --> 07:23.630
I suspect the killer

07:25.030 --> 07:25.910
is Hu Yuanzhong.

07:28.710 --> 07:29.630
He's from Liehe.

07:30.310 --> 07:30.990
The Liehe tribe

07:31.310 --> 07:31.990
is forested,

07:32.430 --> 07:33.310
dark, and damp

07:33.830 --> 07:34.990
all year round.

07:35.790 --> 07:37.190
The Liehe tribe uses

07:37.510 --> 07:38.870
distinctively designed scimitars.

07:39.230 --> 07:40.070
(Their soldiers)

07:40.110 --> 07:41.310
(used that kind of weapon,)

07:41.670 --> 07:42.990
(making them develop rashes)

07:43.110 --> 07:43.909
(on their hands.)

07:44.350 --> 07:45.190
Hu Yuanzhong

07:45.550 --> 07:46.870
claims to be a hunter.

07:47.190 --> 07:47.790
Typically,

07:48.030 --> 07:48.630
hunters

07:48.750 --> 07:50.150
don't use scimitars often.

07:50.670 --> 07:51.430
So, why

07:51.590 --> 07:53.670
are there the same rashes on his hands?

07:55.990 --> 07:56.510
Moreover,

07:57.150 --> 07:58.990
he said he missed his deceased wife,

07:59.909 --> 08:00.950
yet he secretly

08:01.310 --> 08:02.790
lusts after Miss Song's beauty.

08:05.310 --> 08:06.390
Do you have solid evidence?

08:06.870 --> 08:08.750
He carries a note on him,

08:09.110 --> 08:11.430
claiming it's a poem
in Liehe's language from his wife.

08:12.510 --> 08:13.190
But I believe

08:13.350 --> 08:14.390
it's not that simple.

08:15.470 --> 08:16.350
Let's find someone

08:16.390 --> 08:18.270
fluent in Liehe's language
to decipher it.

08:18.830 --> 08:19.390
Also,

08:19.670 --> 08:20.750
during the earlier fight,

08:21.150 --> 08:21.990
I struck his chest

08:22.190 --> 08:22.990
with a bamboo pole.

08:23.510 --> 08:24.550
You can have someone check

08:24.710 --> 08:25.990
if he went out tonight

08:26.350 --> 08:27.070
and if he

08:27.110 --> 08:27.950
has fresh injuries.

08:31.150 --> 08:31.590
Sir.

08:32.070 --> 08:33.190
From Hai hour to Zi hour,

08:33.429 --> 08:34.309
I was on patrol duty.

08:34.750 --> 08:37.270
The light in Hu Yuanzhong's room
is out at Hai hour,

08:37.470 --> 08:38.429
and he didn't go out.

08:38.909 --> 08:39.460
Go.

08:39.669 --> 08:40.630
Bring Hu Yuanzhong here.

08:40.860 --> 08:41.470
Yes.

08:50.910 --> 08:52.830
Sir. Hu Yuanzhong is here.

08:56.670 --> 08:57.230
Sir.

08:58.470 --> 08:59.430
Strip his clothes.

09:02.500 --> 09:03.030
You...

09:03.030 --> 09:03.580
Stop it!

09:05.070 --> 09:05.710
Stop this!

09:05.870 --> 09:06.630
Stop!

09:07.360 --> 09:07.950
Sir.

09:07.950 --> 09:08.670
May I know why?

09:20.790 --> 09:21.670
By your account,

09:21.910 --> 09:23.230
you beat him with a stick.

09:23.230 --> 09:24.510
His body should get the bruise.

09:25.230 --> 09:26.230
Yet as you saw,

09:26.510 --> 09:28.190
no bruise on his right shoulder.

09:28.790 --> 09:29.510
Mr. Shen.

09:30.070 --> 09:31.550
He must have an accomplice here.

09:31.830 --> 09:32.710
Maybe the accomplice

09:32.870 --> 09:33.790
is in Yezhou Garrison.

09:34.110 --> 09:34.710
Enough.

09:34.910 --> 09:35.550
Mr. Shen,

09:35.670 --> 09:36.310
you distrust me?

09:36.470 --> 09:37.510
I can't trust your side

09:37.630 --> 09:38.590
of the story.

09:39.190 --> 09:40.910
We caught you red-handed.

09:41.310 --> 09:41.870
Guards!

09:42.150 --> 09:43.270
Take He Yan to the dungeon

09:43.670 --> 09:44.950
and await judgment.

09:45.550 --> 09:46.630
Imprison me if you must,

09:47.350 --> 09:48.030
but you must

09:48.070 --> 09:49.190
investigate this thoroughly,

09:49.550 --> 09:50.350
or Yezhou Garrison

09:50.430 --> 09:51.310
faces grave peril.

09:52.710 --> 09:53.440
Take him away.

09:53.670 --> 09:54.270
- Yes.
- Yes.

10:18.390 --> 10:19.710
(Now that I'm imprisoned,)

10:20.470 --> 10:21.920
(Yezhou Garrison has only recruits)

10:22.470 --> 10:23.550
(who never go to war,)

10:24.550 --> 10:26.110
(with Liehe infiltrators among them.)

10:27.420 --> 10:28.580
(Enemies lurk in shadows.)

10:28.950 --> 10:30.270
(I guess they tried so hard)

10:30.510 --> 10:31.270
(to frame me)

10:31.830 --> 10:32.870
(for something big.)

10:35.950 --> 10:36.630
(Well,)

10:38.030 --> 10:39.590
(if the news from Litai)

10:39.790 --> 10:40.910
(is fabricated)

10:41.790 --> 10:43.230
(to lure Xiao Jue away,)

10:44.190 --> 10:45.390
(then the Yezhou Garrison)

10:45.790 --> 10:46.910
(will be controlled)

10:47.630 --> 10:49.190
(by the enemies.)

11:18.270 --> 11:18.750
He.

11:19.670 --> 11:20.190
He.

11:22.430 --> 11:23.150
Miss Song.

11:32.870 --> 11:33.950
Stay out of this.

11:34.110 --> 11:34.660
Go back now.

11:35.470 --> 11:36.310
I have medicine.

11:36.670 --> 11:37.430
If I have to,

11:37.470 --> 11:38.950
Cheng Lisu and I will drug them all.

11:39.150 --> 11:40.150
We'll rescue you first.

11:40.350 --> 11:41.710
Wait for Commander Xiao's return.

11:43.070 --> 11:44.070
By the time he returns,

11:44.710 --> 11:45.830
it'll probably be too late.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.870
Can you give me the knockout drug?

11:58.830 --> 11:59.750
May I

12:00.670 --> 12:01.470
have your belt too?

12:22.460 --> 12:23.310
In the coming days,

12:23.310 --> 12:24.070
Mr. Cheng and you

12:24.510 --> 12:25.510
must stay close

12:25.550 --> 12:26.670
to Mr. Shen at all times.

12:26.950 --> 12:27.750
He can protect you.

12:34.550 --> 12:36.350
Help me deliver this to Mr. Shen.

12:36.670 --> 12:37.230
Alright.

12:39.470 --> 12:40.190
Hurry back now.

12:56.550 --> 12:57.830
He asked me to give you this.

13:10.030 --> 13:11.550
Why aren't you saying anything?

13:12.070 --> 13:12.830
He is so kind.

13:12.870 --> 13:14.070
How could he possibly kill?

13:14.270 --> 13:15.510
Release him immediately.

13:15.710 --> 13:16.350
Mr. Shen,

13:16.630 --> 13:18.210
killing a comrade is a grave crime.

13:18.350 --> 13:19.590
Moreover, He Yan has no motive

13:19.630 --> 13:20.510
to kill Ma Damei.

13:20.950 --> 13:21.630
So, we should

13:21.630 --> 13:22.870
carefully examine the corpse

13:22.910 --> 13:24.550
to verify if there's
only one fatal wound

13:24.550 --> 13:25.600
before making judgments.

13:27.910 --> 13:29.110
Mr. Cheng makes a valid point.

13:29.590 --> 13:30.190
It's late.

13:31.300 --> 13:31.910
You two

13:32.230 --> 13:33.550
should go back.

13:33.870 --> 13:34.430
Guards!

13:34.910 --> 13:36.150
Escort Mr. Cheng

13:36.190 --> 13:37.110
and Miss Song back.

13:37.310 --> 13:38.590
If anything happens to them,

13:38.870 --> 13:40.030
I'll hold you accountable!

13:40.160 --> 13:40.670
Understood.

13:42.690 --> 13:43.200
Please.

13:49.150 --> 13:49.830
Issue orders.

13:50.790 --> 13:52.350
Tighten security and increase patrols.

13:52.990 --> 13:53.950
Sentries in pairs,

13:54.390 --> 13:55.150
rotating

13:55.270 --> 13:56.270
in five watches

13:56.630 --> 13:57.630
until dawn.

13:57.890 --> 13:58.460
Yes.

14:28.350 --> 14:29.430
He is still in prison.

14:30.190 --> 14:31.510
We must figure out something.

14:32.070 --> 14:33.550
The weather is getting cold.

14:33.670 --> 14:34.710
The dungeon has nothing.

14:34.950 --> 14:35.830
The cold might

14:36.190 --> 14:37.390
make him sick.

14:37.470 --> 14:39.590
Cut it out!

14:40.030 --> 14:41.590
Go to find Mr. Shen

14:41.710 --> 14:44.290
and plead for mercy.

14:44.290 --> 14:44.870
Go!

14:44.870 --> 14:45.630
Come on.

14:59.200 --> 15:00.060
(Yezhou Garrison)

15:20.270 --> 15:20.790
Who's there?

15:21.270 --> 15:22.670
How dare you barge in!

15:23.310 --> 15:25.190
I am General Rida Muzi

15:25.870 --> 15:26.990
of the Liehe tribe!

15:27.510 --> 15:28.350
I came today

15:28.910 --> 15:30.670
to annihilate the Yezhou Garrison.

15:33.030 --> 15:33.990
Rida Muzi?

15:35.830 --> 15:37.910
Surrender obediently,

15:38.390 --> 15:39.710
and I might consider

15:40.390 --> 15:41.870
sparing your lives.

15:42.350 --> 15:44.550
(He Yan didn't lie.)

15:44.750 --> 15:46.190
Commander Xiao and his men are away.

15:46.590 --> 15:47.590
He remains imprisoned.

15:48.110 --> 15:48.870
What should we do?

15:49.030 --> 15:50.670
Mai, shut up!

15:51.390 --> 15:52.310
Don't let them hear.

16:48.190 --> 16:49.590
I've waited long for you,

16:50.070 --> 16:50.830
Lei Hou.

16:53.110 --> 16:54.150
You used the same move

16:54.510 --> 16:55.630
during the flag contest.

16:55.830 --> 16:57.350
I remember it well.

16:57.910 --> 16:59.550
You killed Instructor Ma and framed me.

16:59.950 --> 17:00.990
You feigned illness

17:01.350 --> 17:02.670
to stay for something.

17:03.150 --> 17:03.830
Now,

17:03.870 --> 17:05.230
you rush to assassinate me.

17:05.589 --> 17:06.790
Is it because you know

17:07.190 --> 17:08.630
you can't beat me?

17:16.990 --> 17:18.150
Now, you finally realize

17:18.310 --> 17:20.390
who's the number one
in the Yezhou Garrison?

17:26.390 --> 17:27.230
Years ago,

17:27.589 --> 17:29.550
General Feihong
defeated the Liehe tribe.

17:29.830 --> 17:30.550
I thought

17:30.870 --> 17:32.910
the Liehe tribe had
been thoroughly subdued.

17:33.510 --> 17:35.350
When my army

17:35.710 --> 17:37.430
crushes the Xiao Army,

17:37.870 --> 17:39.950
it will be too late for you

17:40.350 --> 17:41.830
to beg for your life.

17:42.550 --> 17:43.510
The Yezhou Garrison

17:43.790 --> 17:45.150
is defended by General Fengyun.

17:45.390 --> 17:47.350
How dare you act so recklessly!

17:50.190 --> 17:51.550
General Fengyun?

18:16.700 --> 18:17.310
Commander.

18:17.590 --> 18:18.230
Something's off.

18:34.710 --> 18:36.030
General Fengyun

18:37.590 --> 18:39.350
can't even protect himself now.

18:40.270 --> 18:42.470
Don't expect him to save you.

18:42.670 --> 18:43.940
Commander might be in danger.

18:44.670 --> 18:45.550
These bandits

18:45.790 --> 18:46.870
planned this all along.

18:47.670 --> 18:48.870
People die on the battlefield.

18:49.510 --> 18:51.670
How can we be shackled by fear of death?

18:52.750 --> 18:54.110
Soldiers of the Yezhou Garrison

18:54.590 --> 18:55.910
would rather die in battle

18:56.350 --> 18:57.710
than live in cowardice.

18:58.230 --> 18:59.190
Xiao Army!

18:59.390 --> 19:00.630
Go into formation!

19:00.710 --> 19:01.470
- Yes!
- Yes!

19:04.750 --> 19:05.430
Fine.

19:05.910 --> 19:07.390
Since you all seek death,

19:07.710 --> 19:09.710
we'll slaughter every one of you

19:09.990 --> 19:11.390
and drown Yezhou Garrison in blood!

19:26.390 --> 19:27.350
How dare you!

19:28.910 --> 19:30.150
Who are you?

19:31.230 --> 19:32.470
(Commander won't return soon.)

19:33.230 --> 19:33.790
(Our troops)

19:34.390 --> 19:35.710
(can't match Liehe's soldiers.)

19:36.590 --> 19:37.470
(Fighting recklessly)

19:38.070 --> 19:39.310
(would make us die.)

19:42.590 --> 19:43.580
(Capturing their leader)

19:44.070 --> 19:45.230
(will make things easier.)

19:49.070 --> 19:49.990
I am He Yan,

19:51.470 --> 19:53.270
the top warrior of Yezhou Garrison.

19:55.190 --> 19:57.190
I hear Rida Muji, your brother,

19:57.790 --> 19:59.150
is the former general.

20:00.110 --> 20:01.470
He loved

20:01.790 --> 20:03.150
to behead

20:03.190 --> 20:03.910
captives

20:04.470 --> 20:06.150
and tie them to his horse's tail.

20:06.750 --> 20:08.110
Everywhere he went,

20:08.790 --> 20:10.510
Wei people trembled in fear.

20:12.750 --> 20:13.550
Guess what?

20:14.030 --> 20:14.950
Before long,

20:15.910 --> 20:16.830
General Feihong

20:17.470 --> 20:18.950
effortlessly

20:19.550 --> 20:21.190
chopped off his head.

20:22.230 --> 20:23.230
Exactly!

20:24.030 --> 20:24.750
General.

20:25.070 --> 20:25.750
Why don't we

20:26.310 --> 20:27.150
hold a duel here

20:27.750 --> 20:29.390
today?

20:29.790 --> 20:30.990
Who do you think you are

20:31.550 --> 20:32.630
to challenge me?

20:33.430 --> 20:35.510
You're so arrogant!

20:37.470 --> 20:38.630
I just want

20:39.390 --> 20:41.590
to see if I can chop off your head

20:41.950 --> 20:42.870
and tie it

20:43.510 --> 20:45.230
to my horse's tail too.

20:46.510 --> 20:47.350
Very well.

20:47.550 --> 20:48.310
Teach him a lesson.

20:48.630 --> 20:50.070
In that case,

20:51.150 --> 20:53.030
I'll give you a quick death.

20:53.860 --> 20:54.430
By the way,

20:55.310 --> 20:56.150
what's your wager

20:56.510 --> 20:58.310
for this duel?

20:58.790 --> 20:59.510
Well,

21:00.270 --> 21:01.310
let me propose first.

21:02.430 --> 21:03.270
If I lose,

21:03.630 --> 21:04.630
do with me as you will.

21:05.310 --> 21:06.510
But if you lose,

21:08.710 --> 21:10.350
you must call me Father.

21:29.470 --> 21:30.350
Very funny.

21:31.230 --> 21:32.830
It's surprising

21:33.070 --> 21:34.310
to meet an interesting

21:34.470 --> 21:35.670
and brave man like you.

21:37.230 --> 21:39.590
You deserve to be the top one.

21:40.470 --> 21:41.390
Very good.

21:42.070 --> 21:42.950
I like to play

21:42.990 --> 21:44.230
with a tough guy.

21:45.470 --> 21:46.510
It will be enjoyable

21:47.390 --> 21:49.230
to crush you.

21:49.910 --> 21:50.990
Let's see

21:52.750 --> 21:53.910
who will

21:54.990 --> 21:56.150
be crushed first.

24:01.190 --> 24:02.510
You're impressive.

24:04.190 --> 24:05.230
Same to you.

24:12.070 --> 24:14.270
Let's see how much longer you can last.

24:15.230 --> 24:16.110
Your blood

24:16.910 --> 24:18.510
is nearly drained dry.

24:39.670 --> 24:40.430
In his condition,

24:40.670 --> 24:41.550
he won't last long.

24:42.270 --> 24:42.990
He's wounded.

24:43.630 --> 24:44.390
We can

24:45.110 --> 24:45.870
fight together.

24:46.510 --> 24:47.870
Anyway, we can't watch him die.

24:48.030 --> 24:48.580
True.

24:53.430 --> 24:54.470
Mr. Shen.

24:55.230 --> 24:56.390
Should we attack?

24:56.710 --> 24:57.670
- Charge!
- Charge!

25:02.190 --> 25:02.830
Mr. Shen.

25:08.870 --> 25:10.950
Are all people in the Central Plains

25:11.870 --> 25:13.390
as pretentious as you?

25:13.870 --> 25:14.870
Not exactly.

25:15.430 --> 25:16.110
However,

25:16.630 --> 25:18.750
I'm exceptionally good at pretense.

25:20.670 --> 25:22.550
You remind me of someone.

25:23.030 --> 25:23.590
Who?

25:24.150 --> 25:25.950
My unfortunate brother once said

25:26.590 --> 25:28.470
that when He Rufei, the General Feihong,

25:29.190 --> 25:30.790
took an arrow in battle,

25:31.190 --> 25:32.670
he could take out the shaft

25:32.710 --> 25:34.150
and keep fighting.

25:35.790 --> 25:36.790
You

25:37.790 --> 25:39.390
resemble him greatly.

25:41.550 --> 25:42.230
You're wrong.

25:43.310 --> 25:44.470
I'm not He Rufei,

25:46.150 --> 25:47.150
nor do I resemble him.

25:50.030 --> 25:51.550
But every warrior of Wei

25:52.390 --> 25:53.830
shares my resolve.

25:54.590 --> 25:55.630
As long as we're alive,

25:56.550 --> 25:57.990
we'll fight to the end!

25:58.150 --> 25:59.390
- Fight to the end!
- Fight to the end!

25:59.750 --> 26:00.950
- Fight to the end!
- Fight to the end!

26:04.990 --> 26:05.790
The Central Plains

26:06.310 --> 26:08.550
breed countless generals
like General Feihong.

26:10.470 --> 26:11.630
How many generals

26:11.950 --> 26:13.270
can the Liehe tribe produce?

26:43.110 --> 26:44.590
Is this all you've got?

26:45.950 --> 26:47.030
You're quite weak.

27:04.950 --> 27:05.750
(Xiao Jue will not)

27:05.790 --> 27:07.110
(fall for a diversionary trap.)

27:07.630 --> 27:08.750
(I have to buy more time.)

27:11.200 --> 27:11.810
He!

27:15.230 --> 27:15.750
Taotao!

27:33.270 --> 27:33.910
Watch out, He!

27:33.910 --> 27:34.550
Look out!

27:34.550 --> 27:35.270
He Yan!

28:02.630 --> 28:03.200
Are you okay?

28:05.110 --> 28:05.950
I'm fine.

28:06.350 --> 28:07.150
But He...

28:08.870 --> 28:10.310
All soldiers!

28:10.470 --> 28:11.310
- Yes!
- Yes!

28:11.670 --> 28:13.230
Capture those men!

28:13.350 --> 28:16.830
- Attack!
- Attack!

28:37.830 --> 28:38.850
Nine Banners Battalion.

28:47.490 --> 28:48.190
He Yan.

28:59.230 --> 28:59.950
Xiao Jue.

29:01.310 --> 29:02.270
You're back.

29:06.910 --> 29:08.190
(The messenger is suspicious.)

29:08.910 --> 29:09.430
(That is)

29:09.430 --> 29:10.670
(a path for Wutuo's invasion.)

29:11.350 --> 29:12.790
(They must be remnants from battle)

29:12.830 --> 29:14.310
(in Que City, ambushing there.)

29:16.510 --> 29:17.790
(They tried to divert us.)

29:18.630 --> 29:19.910
(Yezhou Garrison is in danger.)

29:20.070 --> 29:20.550
Commander,

29:20.790 --> 29:21.790
what should we do?

29:22.710 --> 29:23.710
You'll impersonate me.

29:23.950 --> 29:24.750
We'll go with it.

29:26.630 --> 29:28.110
(Feinu will lead the troop)

29:28.390 --> 29:29.990
(to ambush Wutuo's main force.)

29:30.790 --> 29:31.630
(Coordinate with him)

29:31.910 --> 29:33.190
(and annihilate enemies.)

29:34.310 --> 29:36.540
(I'll take a squad
to reinforce Yezhou Garrison.)

30:00.470 --> 30:01.980
Why is it that every time we meet,

30:02.470 --> 30:03.230
you end up

30:03.270 --> 30:04.230
in such a pitiful state?

30:08.070 --> 30:09.630
Maybe because,

30:10.270 --> 30:11.270
well,

30:14.390 --> 30:15.710
I always know

30:17.590 --> 30:18.910
you'll help me out.

30:24.190 --> 30:24.710
He Yan.

30:41.070 --> 30:41.590
What?

30:42.270 --> 30:43.200
Check her pulse.

30:43.510 --> 30:43.990
No need.

30:44.110 --> 30:45.270
I can tell what's wrong.

30:45.390 --> 30:46.400
Dress the wounds first.

30:47.460 --> 30:48.110
Listen,

30:48.470 --> 30:49.150
check her pulse.

30:51.030 --> 30:51.790
Fine.

31:08.670 --> 31:09.230
She's...

31:09.550 --> 31:10.110
A girl.

31:11.150 --> 31:11.670
Xiao Jue.

31:12.070 --> 31:13.230
So, you've been

31:14.430 --> 31:15.390
keeping a beauty.

31:16.790 --> 31:17.910
No wonder you've been

31:17.950 --> 31:19.470
so attentive and accommodating

31:19.710 --> 31:20.510
to her.

31:20.790 --> 31:21.950
You always took her with you

31:22.670 --> 31:23.350
and even let her

31:23.430 --> 31:24.590
stay next door to you.

31:25.310 --> 31:26.990
Turns out you are

31:27.190 --> 31:28.230
in love.

31:28.230 --> 31:28.830
Are you done?

31:29.390 --> 31:30.910
Keep blabbering, and she'll die.

31:33.390 --> 31:34.230
How could you curse

31:34.270 --> 31:35.150
a lady like that?

31:36.390 --> 31:37.830
It's pretty embarrassing.

31:38.070 --> 31:39.710
I kept calling her Mr. He

31:39.750 --> 31:40.670
all this time.

31:42.110 --> 31:43.070
Now,

31:43.310 --> 31:45.510
should I switch to calling her Miss He

31:46.110 --> 31:47.030
or Mrs. Xiao?

31:47.030 --> 31:48.350
Stop nagging, or I'll punish you.

31:57.590 --> 31:58.550
She's severely injured.

31:59.110 --> 32:00.350
Even most men can't bear it.

32:01.030 --> 32:01.910
I wonder how she

32:01.910 --> 32:02.710
endures this?

32:04.990 --> 32:05.950
Remove her garment.

32:05.950 --> 32:06.670
Expose her back.

32:07.190 --> 32:08.700
Clean the blood with warm water.

32:08.990 --> 32:10.070
Then apply the medicine.

32:10.790 --> 32:11.750
You were wounded too,

32:12.070 --> 32:13.270
so you know the routine well.

32:13.630 --> 32:14.510
Uncle.

32:18.750 --> 32:19.270
And you?

32:19.910 --> 32:21.950
I'll decoct herbal medicine for her.

33:33.150 --> 33:38.480
♪Walking through the crowd,
without asking about the future♪

33:40.160 --> 33:44.100
♪Wandering half a lifetime,
solitary as the moon♪

33:46.240 --> 33:51.390
♪I failed to let it go and kept looking♪

33:51.390 --> 33:52.150
Commander.

33:54.070 --> 33:54.670
Does it hurt?

33:57.750 --> 33:58.430
No.

34:01.470 --> 34:02.230
In front of me,

34:03.150 --> 34:03.870
no need to lie.

34:08.219 --> 34:12.270
♪Just to tread the snow you described♪

34:12.270 --> 34:12.949
Commander.

34:14.750 --> 34:15.630
Did I

34:17.030 --> 34:17.790
do well?

34:21.730 --> 34:28.449
♪It's hard to sever love or hatred♪

34:28.800 --> 34:35.710
♪Before fate is confirmed♪

34:35.710 --> 34:41.440
♪My love for you burns fiercely♪

34:42.239 --> 34:46.179
♪Lifelong devotion turns into a vow♪

34:46.179 --> 34:49.179
♪That's my last wish♪

34:50.500 --> 34:55.810
♪Awaiting the spread of moonlight♪

35:04.390 --> 35:06.550
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

35:06.650 --> 35:10.570
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

35:10.750 --> 35:12.690
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

35:12.790 --> 35:17.720
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

35:29.810 --> 35:31.220
♪I've seen the mountains♪

35:31.420 --> 35:32.830
♪And trodden through ice♪

35:33.100 --> 35:35.920
♪Day after day, I venture alone♪

35:36.220 --> 35:37.610
♪Destiny is my creed♪

35:37.670 --> 35:39.070
♪Ideals surge beneath the surface♪

35:39.220 --> 35:41.020
♪Igniting the flame against the winds♪

35:42.220 --> 35:43.690
♪A restless yearning in my soul♪

35:43.860 --> 35:45.140
♪Gazing through the mire♪

35:45.320 --> 35:47.710
♪Who cares about this boundless void♪

35:47.910 --> 35:49.960
♪Charge ahead with blazing fervor♪

35:51.100 --> 35:52.930
♪Stubbornly fighting with my life♪

35:54.890 --> 35:57.800
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

35:57.890 --> 36:00.560
♪There must always be a longing♪

36:01.010 --> 36:06.070
♪Disregard the wounds to seek the light♪

36:06.410 --> 36:08.410
♪Light shines upon my heart♪

36:08.730 --> 36:12.370
♪Unveiling scars,
I choose to swim upstream♪

36:12.610 --> 36:14.500
♪The resonance of courage
rings loud and clear♪

36:14.530 --> 36:18.380
♪It's the boldness
that defines existence♪

36:18.730 --> 36:20.670
♪Chasing the light within my heart♪

36:20.860 --> 36:24.680
♪Burying frailty,
embracing life through death♪

36:24.940 --> 36:30.690
♪You'll meet gazes where storms brew♪

36:31.580 --> 36:37.040
♪With our unwavering true love,
brave the world with me♪

36:44.200 --> 36:47.120
♪Soaring across the world's expanse♪

36:47.210 --> 36:49.870
